# Probe 2: the Desktop-configuration dialog (ADDESKCF). Opens Options ->
# Desktop configuration... and lets `probe_tree` dump every object's absolute
# rectangle, which is where the DESK19 *Parameter* click points come from.
#   Options title hover (196,9), `Desktop configuration...` (280,123)  [probe 1]
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 196 240
1900 move 196 9
2500 mark B_MENU
2700 move 280 123
3100 down
3103 up
3700 parkbr
4600 mark C_CONF
5600 pause
